    "before" : {

    },
    "BEFORE READING THIS MODULE, HOW CONFIDENT WERE YOU IN YOUR PRIOR BELIEF?" : {

    },
    "Before responding, restate the best version of what they're saying:\n\n\"So what I hear you saying is — [best version of their concern]. Is that right?\"\n\nThis demonstrates genuine listening, often earns reciprocal good faith, and forces you to engage with the actual argument — not the trigger word." : {

    },
    "before the programming could reach you." : {

    },
    "Before voting, find out:" : {
