    "ESTIMATED TIME RECLAIMED" : {

    },
    "ETYMOLOGY IS GNOSIS" : {

    },
    "Evaluate candidates with transparency.\nNo spin. No illusions. Just data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Evalúa candidatos con transparencia.\nSin giros. Sin ilusiones. Solo datos."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Evalúa candidatos con transparencia.\nSin giros. Sin ilusiones. Solo datos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Even if you meditate and visualize for an hour, what about the other 15+ hours? You are in INFINITE ACTION—always dwelling on something in thought and feeling." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Incluso si meditas y visualizas por una hora, ¿qué pasa con las otras 15+ horas? Estás en ACCIÓN INFINITA—siempre habitando en algo en pensamiento y sentimiento."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Incluso si meditas y visualizas por una hora, ¿qué pasa con las otras 15+ horas? Estás en ACCIÓN INFINITA—siempre habitando en algo en pensamiento y sentimiento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Even small wins count..." : {

    },
    "Even something small counts" : {

    },
    "Evening" : {

    },
    "EVENING REFLECTION" : {

    },
    "Every 80 years, the monetary system resets. Not sometimes. EVERY time." : {

    },
    "Every angel name ends in EL because they all represent different aspects of the God impulse working through you:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada nombre de ángel termina en EL porque todos representan diferentes aspectos del impulso divino trabajando a través de ti:"
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada nombre de ángel termina en EL porque todos representan diferentes aspectos del impulso divino trabajando a través de ti:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every awakening path has been walked by millions before you. Trust the process, but always listen to your body and mind. If something doesn't feel right, slow down or seek guidance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada camino de despertar ha sido recorrido por millones antes que tú. Confía en el proceso, pero siempre escucha a tu cuerpo y mente. Si algo no se siente bien, reduce la velocidad o busca orientación."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada camino de despertar ha sido recorrido por millones antes que tú. Confía en el proceso, pero siempre escucha a tu cuerpo y mente. Si algo no se siente bien, reduce la velocidad o busca orientación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every culture on Earth — YOUR ancestors — revered the Sun before imperialism erased it." : {

    },
    "Every day at" : {

    },
    "Every division you checked costs someone money to amplify. That cost is an investment. The return on investment is your attention, your vote, or your inability to coordinate with someone on your side of a real economic issue." : {

    },
    "Every entry below is documented historical fact. Read and note which one surprises you most." : {

    },
    "Every feature is a lever.\nEvery lever pulls your attention." : {

    },
    "Every flagged ingredient has a cleaner alternative. We don't just scare you — we give you the upgrade path." : {

    },
    "Every journey needs a companion" : {

    },
    "Every lesson ends with a SunFlow critical analysis — separating real insights from manipulation." : {

    },
    "Every major distraction hides a real move.\nHere's the pattern, exposed." : {

    },
    "Every moment borrowed from initial order." : {

    },
    "Every moment you choose depth over speed, curiosity over certainty, reflection over reaction—you ASCEND." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada momento que eliges profundidad sobre velocidad, curiosidad sobre certeza, reflexión sobre reacción—ASCIENDES."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada momento que eliges profundidad sobre velocidad, curiosidad sobre certeza, reflexión sobre reacción—ASCIENDES."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every morning at %@ AM:" : {

    },
    "Every path leads through history. The patterns are undeniable." : {

    },
    "Every path to truth starts with a question.\nLet us find the right door for you." : {

    },
    "Every person has a money story—beliefs formed from:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada persona tiene una historia con el dinero—creencias formadas de:"
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada persona tiene una historia con el dinero—creencias formadas de:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every piece of knowledge in Aperture can be traced back to its original source — ancient texts, academic scholarship, archaeological records, and peer-reviewed research. We don't ask you to take our word for it. We give you the sources and encourage you to explore them yourself." : {

    },
    "Every prayer, every sermon, every 'holy' word carries the buried light of what they suppressed. The sun worship never ended. It just went underground—into language." : {

    },
    "Every religion on Earth tells the same story.\nNot because they copied each other —\nbecause they all looked at the same sky." : {

    },
    "EVERY RELIGION TEACHES YOU TO WAIT:" : {

    },
    "Every ritual has a hidden meaning. They make you perform these acts without knowing what you're actually invoking." : {

    },
    "Every row is a different tradition.\nEvery column is the same question.\nNotice the patterns." : {

    },
    "Every time you cross yourself, you activate\nthe control program and seal it with Egypt. 😂" : {

    },
    "Every tradition describes the same process:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada tradición describe el mismo proceso:"
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada tradición describe el mismo proceso:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every tradition drew this building.\nDifferent architects. Same structure." : {

    },
    "Everyone Else" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todos los Demás"
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todos los Demás"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything flows in cycles" : {

    },
    "Everything here links to primary sources: DOJ cases, FDA communications, Senate reports, peer-reviewed journals, or declassified government documents. These are not theories - they are documented institutional actions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todo aquí enlaza a fuentes primarias: casos del DOJ, comunicaciones de la FDA, informes del Senado, revistas revisadas por pares, o documentos gubernamentales desclasificados. Estas no son teorías - son acciones institucionales documentadas."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todo aquí enlaza a fuentes primarias: casos del DOJ, comunicaciones de la FDA, informes del Senado, revistas revisadas por pares, o documentos gubernamentales desclasificados. Estas no son teorías - son acciones institucionales documentadas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything in this app was built to support\nyour continued growth. Explore freely." : {

    },
    "Everything in this course is sourced from congressional hearings, court records, declassified documents, and public contracts. This is not conspiracy. This is the documented record." : {

    },
    "Everything you're experiencing—your relationships, your bank account, your struggles, your successes—is showing you YOU. The mirror is not random circumstances, not punishment, not luck. It's a reflection of your internal state." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
