    },
    "This course presents documented history using primary sources: diaries, letters, official documents, and statements from historical figures themselves. We distinguish between Judaism (a religion), Jewish people (an ethnic/religious group), and Zionism (a political ideology). Criticism of Israeli government policies is not antisemitism, just as criticism of any government is not hatred of its people." : {
